on others --

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:56.133
-Oh, yeah.
-You do.

00:00:56.133 --> 00:00:57.133
-Oh yeah.
-Really?

00:00:57.133 --> 00:00:58.467
-We go full out.
-You do?

00:00:58.467 --> 00:01:00.334
